</span>
<span style="border-top:1px solid #dcdfe3;margin-top:4px;padding-top:4px;font-weight:bold" id="stepTitle"></span>
<p id="demoNarration" style="margin:0;font-size:11px;line-height:1.4;max-width:100%"></p>
<span style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center">
